      "comment": "Alain Guillotin: Sandrone and Alain's Creation",
      "content": "Alain finished Sandrone on his 65th birthday after modelling her on his dead sister. He agreed she was very different from Mary-Ann and wanted her to act on her own will. She learned fast, kept notebooks, and became his colleague. Before he died he asked her to burn his manuscripts; she read them first and kept the genius alive.",
