      "comment": "Alain Guillotin: Pulonia",
      "content": "Pulonia was Alain's last creation: a purely mechanical assistant designed as an algorithm for calculating the unknown. Alain was unsatisfied, since even he did not know what the unknown was. He left it to Sandrone, who kept it close and passed it off as her attendant until Dottore destroyed it.",
