      "comment": "Alain Guillotin: The Clash at Elynas",
      "content": "The Marechaussee Phantom assigned Alain and Mary-Ann to capture the Ordo's members. At the remains of Elynas the two sides fought; an explosion damaged Seymour and likely killed Mary-Ann, and Alain defeated Narzissenkreuz.",
