      "comment": "Alain Guillotin: Rene, Jakob and Carter",
      "content": "Alain, Rene and Jakob were childhood friends. When Carter fell ill, Rene and Jakob experimented on him with materials from Elynas. Carter died and Alain broke with them. Alain gave each friend a matching pocket watch. Rene became Narzissenkreuz, and Jakob survives to the present.",
