      "comment": "Alain Guillotin: Alain's Legacy in Fontaine",
      "content": "The Institute he founded still exists, and his clockwork meka are still produced. The Suppression Specialist Mek is named after Carter. The Romaritime and Lumidouce Harbor lifts follow his designs. Legends of a thinking machine inspired Fontaine's attempts at artificial intelligence.",
